7f20f&oh=00_AQS68K3xIS2k8QAgVzv9fxim7VsGxFxXCi0nih1PcojsLA&oe=6AFDC53C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Monke Run\u200e", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Your Normal Monke game... right? Well No actually! It is better then most games, First we ofc gotta talk about the graphics, Cmonnnn aren't they good arent they beautifullll? Just look at the pictures shown on the page. All jokes aside this game has: Great and active moderators,A Good Horror mode thats actually pretty scary, Awesome cosmetics,Special cosmetics for cool people, A pvp map and so much more! And heres the best part, if you become trusted enough and if you play enough you might become a trial mod or even better... A MODERATOR!!! Or you could just simply join the discord and apply for moderator.                                                                                                                                                                     If you do however install the game just remember to read the rules, be nice to other monkes And the most important rule.... HAVE FUN!!!", "short_description": "Your Normal Monke game... right? Well No actually! It is better then most games, This game has: Great and active moderators,Beautiful maps,A Good Horror mode thats actually pretty scary, Awesome cosmetics,Special cosmetics for cool people, A pvp map and so much more! And heres the best part, if you become trusted enough and if you play enough you might become a trial mod or even better... A MODERATOR!!! Or you could just simply join the discord and apply for moderator."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/ca8655a3-20d9-4b2a-8724-dbfdca6d6497", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "PizzarBandaids", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkerunofficialsite/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_cat